 01 WS-IN                  PIC X(160).
 01 WS-TOK                 PIC X(24).
 01 WS-P                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
